t true.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A\n\nStep-by-Step Explanation:\n\n1. **Harry is smart** (given).\n2. **Smart \u2192 kind** (from fact 8), so Harry is kind.\n3. **Kind \u2192 quiet** (from fact 11), so Harry is quiet.\n4. **Quiet and smart \u2192 blue** (from fact 9), so Harry is blue.\n5. **Blue and smart \u2192 red** (from fact 14), so Harry is red.\n6. **Red \u2192 furry** (from fact 13), so Harry is furry.\n\nAnswer: A) True",
