ink>\n\nThe correct option is: A\n\nStep-by-Step Explanation:\n\n1. **Harry's Attributes**: Harry is not cold (point 4) and is red (point 5).\n\n2. **Red Things**: Red things are not kind (point 6). Since Harry is red, he is not kind.\n\n3. **Kindness and Fur**: If something is kind and not furry, it's green (point 12). Harry is not kind, so this doesn't apply.\n\n4. **Cold and Furry**: If something is cold and not furry, it's not kind (point 7). Harry is not cold, so this doesn't apply.\n\n5. **Rough Things**: Rough things are green (point 11). Harry is red, so he can't be rough.\n\n6. **Conclusion**: Harry is not rough because rough things are green, and Harry is red.\n\nAnswer: A) True",
