rom the context, Anne is explicitly stated to be \"round\" (point 5).\n\n2. **Verify Through Other Facts**: \n   - Anne is cold (point 1), and cold things are round (point 13). This further confirms her roundness.\n   - Being quiet (point 4) makes her rough (point 12), but this doesn't affect her roundness.\n\n3. **Conclusion**: All evidence points to Anne being round, making the statement true.\n\nThe correct option is: A",
